{"id":"wb-6-918","name":"阜新万人坑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"阜新万人坑","text":"阜新万人坑位于中华人民共和国辽宁省阜新市太平区，是中国抗日战争时期，日本控制阜新煤矿期间死难矿工的集体墓葬，有较大的万人坑四处，埋葬有死难矿工7万余人。阜新煤矿万人坑于1988年被列为辽宁省文物保护单位，2006年，阜新万人坑被中华人民共和国国务院公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%9C%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BA%E5%9D%91","revisionId":93313683,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93313683","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/641d167b693e08676808cc2b.jpg","title":"Fuxin_Memorial_Hall_for_Miners_Died_in_Mass_Graves_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fuxin_Memorial_Hall_for_Miners_Died_in_Mass_Graves_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/Fuxin_Memorial_Hall_for_Miners_Died_in_Mass_Graves_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"红烧腰果","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​死难矿工遗骨馆","width":320,"height":240}}